{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# 🔄 The life of a DRF request\n**One HTTP call, eight checkpoints.** Follow the arrows. The red rail on the right is where each failure exits.\n\n> Debug rule — **401/403:** steps 4–5 · **400:** step 7 · **404:** step 1 or `get_queryset()` · **slow:** step 8","x":-1000,"y":-560,"width":900,"height":180},
		{"id":"svg","type":"file","file":"assets/drf-request-lifecycle.svg","x":-40,"y":-560,"width":800,"height":480},
		{"id":"client","type":"text","text":"### 🌍 Client\n\n```http\nPOST /api/recipe/recipes/\nAuthorization: Token 9c1f…\nContent-Type: application/json\n\n{\"title\":\"Curry\",\"time_minutes\":45,\n \"price\":\"12.00\",\"tags\":[{\"name\":\"Thai\"}]}\n```","x":-1000,"y":-320,"width":460,"height":260,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"n1","type":"text","text":"### 1 · URL Router\n`recipe/urls.py` · `DefaultRouter`\n\nPath → viewset action.\n`POST /recipes/` → `create`\n\n❌ no match → **404**","x":-1000,"y":-20,"width":460,"height":180},
		{"id":"n2","type":"text","text":"### 2 · Django Middleware\nCORS · session · CSRF · your `RequestIDMiddleware`\n\nStill plain Django — DRF hasn't started yet.","x":-1000,"y":200,"width":460,"height":180},
		{"id":"n3","type":"text","text":"### 3 · `APIView.dispatch()`\n\nWraps `request` → DRF `Request`, `Response` → rendered response.\n\n**You are now inside DRF.**","x":-1000,"y":420,"width":460,"height":180,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"n4","type":"text","text":"### 4 · Authentication\n`TokenAuthentication`\n\nReads the header, looks up the token, sets `request.user`.\n\n⚠️ The word is **`Token`**, not `Bearer`.\n\n❌ fails → **401**","x":-480,"y":-20,"width":460,"height":180,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n5","type":"text","text":"### 5 · Permissions + Throttling\n`IsAuthenticated` · custom classes · rate limits\n\n⚠️ `has_object_permission()` is **not called on list endpoints.**\n\n❌ fails → **403** / **429**","x":-480,"y":200,"width":460,"height":180,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n6","type":"text","text":"### 6 · View handler\n`create()` → `perform_create()`\n\n```python\ndef perform_create(self, serializer):\n    serializer.save(user=self.request.user)\n```\n\nThe owner comes from the **token**, never the payload.","x":-480,"y":420,"width":460,"height":220,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"n7","type":"text","text":"### 7 · Serializer\n`is_valid()` → `validated_data` → `create()`\n\nNested tags handled by `get_or_create`.\n\n❌ fails → **400** *(the body names the field)*","x":40,"y":-20,"width":460,"height":180,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n8","type":"text","text":"### 8 · ORM → PostgreSQL\nQuerySet → SQL\n\n```python\n.select_related(\"user\")\n.prefetch_related(\"tags\", \"ingredients\")\n```\n\n⚠️ Without these: 201 queries for 100 rows.","x":40,"y":200,"width":460,"height":220,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n9","type":"text","text":"### 9 · Renderer → Response\n`JSONRenderer` (or BrowsableAPI for a browser)\n\n```\n201 Created\nContent-Type: application/json\n```","x":40,"y":460,"width":460,"height":180,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"exc","type":"text","text":"## 💥 exception_handler\n\nAny raised `APIException` short-circuits straight to a response — the rest of the chain never runs.\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n|**401**|`NotAuthenticated`|\n|**403**|`PermissionDenied`|\n|**404**|`NotFound`|\n|**405**|`MethodNotAllowed`|\n|**429**|`Throttled`|\n|**400**|`ValidationError`|\n\n**500 is different** — that's an unhandled exception, and it is always a bug.","x":560,"y":-20,"width":420,"height":440,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"tip","type":"text","text":"### 🔬 The move that beats guessing\n\n```python\nres = self.client.post(URL, payload)\nprint(res.status_code, res.data)\n```\n\n```bash\ndocker compose logs -f app\n```\n\nDRF nearly always already said what was wrong.","x":560,"y":460,"width":420,"height":180,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"more","type":"file","file":"EN/21.Interview and Real World/Debugging Decision Tree.md","x":-1000,"y":640,"width":460,"height":100}
	],
